# Collection-window config for the 인원 추이 (enrollment trend) history.
#
# Copy to `collect.env` (local runtime configuration) and review every value
# against the current sugang portal schedule before enabling a worker. The
# runtime file is the canonical source; this file only documents its schema.
#
# Each counts pass appends one sample per class. These windows gate WHICH volatile
# metric is recorded — independent of the term's running dates:
#
#   * 장바구니 (cart)   — usually a pre-registration period BEFORE the semester
#   * 수강 인원 (enrolled) — the 수강신청 period (a different window)
#
# Outside a metric's window its column is stored NULL (so the chart shows the
# cart→enrolled hand-off). A blank `*_WINDOWS` value means that metric has no
# date restriction, so set both lists explicitly for a production semester.
#
# Dates are YYYY-MM-DD interpreted in COLLECTION_TIMEZONE.

# Worker scope
COUNT_YEAR="${COUNT_YEAR:-2026}"
COUNT_SEM="${COUNT_SEM:-fall}"
COUNT_MODE="${COUNT_MODE:-cart}"
COLLECTION_TIMEZONE="${COLLECTION_TIMEZONE:-Asia/Seoul}"

# 장바구니 collection window (example: replace for each semester)
CART_WINDOWS="${CART_WINDOWS:-2026-08-04..2026-08-05}"

# 수강 인원 collection windows (example: replace for each semester)
ENROLL_WINDOWS="${ENROLL_WINDOWS:-2026-07-30..2026-07-31,2026-08-07..2026-08-11,2026-08-28..2026-08-31,2026-09-01..2026-09-09}"
